zum Vergleich](/ratgeber/cannabis-telemedizin)","img":{"data":{"id":"2291","attributes":{"alternativeText":"online-cannabis-rezept-telemedizin","width":1200,"height":1200,"mime":"image/jpeg","url":"https://assets-new.flowzz.com/cms/daa9c41b721eeefc467998bcdda448a4.jpg","formats":{"small":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://assets-new.flowzz.com/cms/5498d0a86c53cf42fd07443af7b46780.jpg","hash":"5498d0a86c53cf42fd07443af7b46780","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"small_1.jpg","path":null,"size":21.82,"width":400,"height":400,"sizeInBytes":21818},"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://assets-new.flowzz.com/cms/5b2341dded7d23ab04e457d3ff94b7df.jpg","hash":"5b2341dded7d23ab04e457d3ff94b7df","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_1.jpg","path":null,"size":5.19,"width":156,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":5194}}}}}},{"id":"619","column":"**Cannabis Apotheken Verzeichnis**  \n\n[zur Apotheken Liste](/ratgeber/cannabis-apotheken)","img":{"data":{"id":"2293","attributes":{"alternativeText":"cannabis-apotheken-liste","width":1200,"height":1200,"mime":"image/jpeg","url":"https://assets-new.flowzz.com/cms/c3868285b1bdaef2b423cb1bd390a4f7.jpg","formats":{"small":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://assets-new.flowzz.com/cms/fdf469e6bdee4cb1bbbeef10dfa05860.jpg","hash":"fdf469e6bdee4cb1bbbeef10dfa05860","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"small_3.jpg","path":null,"size":18.15,"width":400,"height":400,"sizeInBytes":18146},"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://assets-new.flowzz.com/cms/6fde0d49ad676d17935af0f506391e0a.jpg","hash":"6fde0d49ad676d17935af0f506391e0a","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_3.jpg","path":null,"size":5.05,"width":156,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":5048}}}}}}],"effects":[{"id":"3","titel":"Cannabisblüten","subTitel":"Preiswerte","content":"##### THC Blüten ab 2,95€!\nLegales Cannabis mit hohen THC Gehalt und bekannte Cali-Strains aus einer Apotheke müssen nicht teuer sein. Klicke hier für die größte, legale Cannabis Datenbank in Deutschland!\n::br\n[Cannabis \u0026 Rezept bestellen](/product)\n[Zeig mir die günstigsten Blüten](/product?sort%5Bn%5D=price\u0026sort%5Bd%5D=1\u0026fav=0\u0026pagination%5Bpage%5D=1\u0026avail=1)","useIcons":true,"useType":"FLOWERPRICE","strain_attributes":{"data":[]}},{"id":"32","titel":"Cannabis Rezept","subTitel":"Ratgeber","content":"##### Unkompliziert zum Cannabis Rezept!\nInformiere dich, wie du Cannabis auf Rezept erhältst. Oder nutze direkt den flowzz Rezeptkonfigurator, der dich Schritt für Schritt zu deinem Wunschrezept führt.\n::br\n[So funktioniert’s!](/rezeptkonfigurator-faq)","useIcons":false,"useType":"PRESCRIPTION","strain_attributes":{"data":[]}},{"id":"12","titel":"Extrakte","subTitel":"Preiswerte","content":"##### Extrakte ab 1,99 € / ml!\nCannabisextrakte unterscheiden sich hauptsächlich durch die Konzentration und das Verhältnis von THC und CBD. Die Wirkung hält oft mehrere Stunden oder sogar den ganzen Tag an. \n::br\n[Alle Extrakte](/extract?sort%5Bn%5D=price\u0026sort%5Bd%5D=1)","useIcons":true,"useType":"EXTRACTPRICE","strain_attributes":{"data":[]}},{"id":"1","titel":"Effekt*","subTitel":"Strains nach","content":"##### Finde deinen persönlichen Strain in einer Cannabis Apotheke!\nJeder Strain hat seine eigenen Eigenschaften und Vorteile. Um den perfekten Strain für dich zu finden, solltest du deine Bedürfnisse und Präferenzen berücksichtigen.*\n::br\n[Entdecke alle Effekte*](/strain)","useIcons":true,"useType":"EFFECT","strain_attributes":{"data":[{"id":"6","attributes":{"labelDE":"Glücklich","type":"effect","order":119}},{"id":"10","attributes":{"labelDE":"Relaxed","type":"effect","order":134}},{"id":"9","attributes":{"labelDE":"Albern","type":"effect","order":112}},{"id":"4","attributes":{"labelDE":"Fokussiert","type":"effect","order":111}},{"id":"2","attributes":{"labelDE":"Energetisch","type":"effect","order":124}},{"id":"1","attributes":{"labelDE":"Kreativ","type":"effect","order":108}},{"id":"7","attributes":{"labelDE":"Gesellig","type":"effect","order":125}},{"id":"5","attributes":{"labelDE":"Euphorisch","type":"effect","order":114}}]}},{"id":"2","titel":"medizinischer Wirkung*","subTitel":"Strains nach potenzieller","content":"##### Finde mögliche Strains für deine Symptomatik!\nCannabis hat eine Vielzahl von medizinischen Anwendungen, von Schmerzlinderung bis hin zur Behandlung von Schlaflosigkeit.\n::br\nWenn du Cannabis aus medizinischen Gründen verwenden möchtest, solltest du einen Strain auswählen, die für deine spezifischen Bedürfnisse geeignet ist.*\n::br\n[Entdecke die Strains](/strain)","useIcons":false,"useType":"EFFECT","strain_attributes":{"data":[{"id":"46","attributes":{"labelDE":"ADHS","type":"medicalUsage","order":50}},{"id":"47","attributes":{"labelDE":"Alzheimer","type":"medicalUsage","order":49}},{"id":"21","attributes":{"labelDE":"Angstzustände","type":"medicalUsage","order":48}},{"id":"17","attributes":{"labelDE":"Appetitlosigkeit","type":"medicalUsage","order":47}},{"id":"48","attributes":{"labelDE":"Asthma","type":"medicalUsage","order":47}},{"id":"49","attributes":{"labelDE":"Arthritis","type":"medicalUsage","order":45}},{"id":"13","attributes":{"labelDE":"Chronische Schmerzen","type":"medicalUsage","order":44}},{"id":"19","attributes":{"labelDE":"Depression","type":"medicalUsage","order":43}},{"id":"50","attributes":{"labelDE":"Entzündungen","type":"medicalUsage","order":42}},{"id":"51","attributes":{"labelDE":"Epilepsie","type":"medicalUsage","order":41}},{"id":"52","attributes":{"labelDE":"Erschöpfung","type":"medicalUsage","order":40}},{"id":"53","attributes":{"labelDE":"Fibromyalgie","type":"medicalUsage","order":39}},{"id":"54","attributes":{"labelDE":"Gastroinestinalstörung","type":"medicalUsage","order":38}},{"id":"55","attributes":{"labelDE":"HIV/AIDS","type":"medicalUsage","order":37}},{"id":"43","attributes":{"labelDE":"Kopfschmerzen","type":"medicalUsage","order":36}},{"id":"56","attributes":{"labelDE":"Krämpfe","type":"medicalUsage","order":35}},{"id":"12","attributes":{"labelDE":"Krebs Begleiterscheinungen","type":